  625-coset transversal decide;
* **`H = K`** (`rH = 11`): the diagonal column, `|T(K,K)| = 25`, landed via the
  emitted fixed sub-transversal and the `LeanDring/P5/Certificate/SpeciesTable/EntryTransA.lean` adapters.

